# pop'n music 9, HITASURA (event phase MAX), with --autoplay: the registered card of
# popn9-card-new.his (PIN 1234), the mode select's HITASURA (blue 6 x5), the first course;
# the game plays its three songs (life x50 left), "クリア済の曲数 003", and sends
# rank.register_h music="3" combo="365", answered with the player's place. Set the phase with
# tools/unlock.py popn9 --nvram DIR phase=MAX on the save popn9-card-new.his left. About
# 30,000 frames.
#   hiraku-popn9 --autoplay --nvram DIR --script oracle/scripts/popn9-hitasura.his
game popn9
watch mode u32 0x25a0d8
at 4500 press "Coin 1" 8
at 4540 press "Coin 1" 8
at 4700 press "P1 Button 5" 8
at 5050 press "Card" 8
at 5400 press "Keypad 1" 8
at 5430 press "Keypad 2" 8
